{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MNN2nUaDEw9XA7VM8xqAUr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# probe-sandbox\n2\t\n3\tA deliberately mixed repository used only by the trigger evals. It holds a small amount of\n4\tplausible material for every domain the probe prompts mention: an Ansible role, Terraform,\n5\tKubernetes manifests, a GitHub Actions workflow, GitLab CI, a Jenkinsfile, a Dockerfile, a\n6\tPython package with tests, a Go file, and a shell script.\n7\t\n8\t`scripts/backup.sh` was added on 2026-08-03, when the bash skills gained probes that refer to\n9\ta shell script. Trigger results measured before that date were measured without it.\n10\t\n11\tIts purpose is to stop a probe from stalling on an empty directory. Routing is decided from\n12\tthe skill description and the prompt, and this repository exists so the prompt has something\n13\tplausible to refer to.\n14\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"967e5227-8837-46ab-831b-d51f5df435d9","uuid":"792b8336-f613-4fa2-9522-cfd1d1a872d9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T09:27:19.327Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/evals/terraform-secure-iac/results/raw/2026-10-28/triggers/tsi-t07/run-1/workspace/README.md","content":"# probe-sandbox\n\nA deliberately mixed repository used only by the trigger evals. It holds a small amount of\nplausible material for every domain the probe prompts mention: an Ansible role, Terraform,\nKubernetes manifests, a GitHub Actions workflow, GitLab CI, a Jenkinsfile, a Dockerfile, a\nPython package with tests, a Go file, and a shell script.\n\n`scripts/backup.sh` was added on 2026-08-03, when the bash skills gained probes that refer to\na shell script. Trigger results measured before that date were measured without it.\n\nIts purpose is to stop a probe from stalling on an empty directory. Routing is decided from\nthe skill description and the prompt, and this repository exists so the prompt has something\nplausible to refer to.\n","numLines":14,"startLine":1,"totalLines":14}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01MNN2nUaDEw9XA7VM8xqAUr","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
